{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "我们简单地擦拭了一下身子，\\n接着开始拼命地打扫活动室。", "steam": "比起清理自己的身體，我們更拼命打掃社團教室。"}, "length": {"chs": 28, "steam": 22}, "similarity": 0.261}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "毕竟刚才做得那么激烈，\\n免不了会有各种各样的液体溅到地板上。", "steam": "因為剛才的性愛實在太激烈，各種液體飛散得到處都是。"}, "length": {"chs": 31, "steam": 25}, "similarity": 0.308}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "而且也正如纱凪所言，\\n再怎么说也至少要避免被社团里的其他人察觉我们在这里做过。", "steam": "而且紗凪說的對，我們絕對不能讓社團的大家發現這件事。"}, "length": {"chs": 40, "steam": 26}, "similarity": 0.194}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「呃、纱凪，纱凪！\\n　你下面的东西又滴到地板上了！」", "steam": "「紗凪、紗凪！妳的胯下有東西滴下來了！滴在地板上！」"}, "length": {"chs": 27, "steam": 26}, "similarity": 0.524}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn7478", "steam": "sn7478", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「啊……没完没了是吧！\\n　都怪新吾！你射了多少进去啊！」", "steam": "「啊……根本掃不乾淨嘛！新吾射太多了，你到底射了多少啊！」"}, "length": {"chs": 29, "steam": 29}, "similarity": 0.465}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「就算你这么问……我只是把“我有的”都……」", "steam": "「呃，就是『全部』而已……」"}, "length": {"chs": 22, "steam": 14}, "similarity": 0.19}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn7479", "steam": "sn7479", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「我也是，到底榨了多少出来啊！\\n　我到底有多喜欢你啊～～～～！」", "steam": "「是說我到底搾了多少啊！我到底多喜歡新吾啦～～～～～～～～！」"}, "length": {"chs": 33, "steam": 31}, "similarity": 0.63}
