{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「你这么想我倒是很高兴啦，但现在先别管这个了！\\n　冷静点，纱凪！」", "steam": "「妳的心意我很高興，但現在先放一邊吧！冷靜一點紗凪，冷靜！」"}, "length": {"chs": 34, "steam": 30}, "similarity": 0.314}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn7494", "steam": "sn7494", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「冷静得下来才怪了！我把那儿擦了又擦，\\n　里面还是有很多你的精液！」", "steam": "「誰能冷靜啊！那邊我已經擦過了，結果新吾的精液又從肚子裡流出來！」"}, "length": {"chs": 35, "steam": 33}, "similarity": 0.316}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「好了好了我知道了！\\n　总之你先冷静下来——」", "steam": "「我知道了、我知道了啦！總之冷靜下來，來，紗凪──」"}, "length": {"chs": 24, "steam": 26}, "similarity": 0.39}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "……虽然花了不少时间，\\n但我们总算打扫完活动室，离开了学校。", "steam": "……雖然花了很多時間，但我們總算把社團教室打掃乾淨，離開了學校。"}, "length": {"chs": 31, "steam": 32}, "similarity": 0.377}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn7495", "steam": "sn7495", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「唉……打扫这么久，要是因为味道暴露了，那可就没脸见人了」", "steam": "「唉……要是結果因為氣味被發現的話就太悲慘了。」"}, "length": {"chs": 29, "steam": 24}, "similarity": 0.333}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「以防万一，我已经通过风了，\\n　我想应该没问题吧……」", "steam": "「已經開窗換氣過了，我想應該沒問題……」"}, "length": {"chs": 28, "steam": 20}, "similarity": 0.222}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn7496", "steam": "sn7496", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「既然已经把能做的都做了，应该没事吧」", "steam": "「好吧，反正能做的都做了，應該沒事。」"}, "length": {"chs": 19, "steam": 19}, "similarity": 0.533}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn7497", "steam": "sn7497", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「如果暴露了，嘿嘿嘿，\\n　你也会负起责任来吧」", "steam": "「就算真的被發現，嘻嘻嘻，新吾也會負責任嘛。」"}, "length": {"chs": 24, "steam": 23}, "similarity": 0.108}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「……我会努力的」", "steam": "「……我會努力。」"}, "length": {"chs": 9, "steam": 9}, "similarity": 0.667}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn7498", "steam": "sn7498", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「真是的，这里可不该这么说吧，\\n　应该是“我们一起承担责任”才对吧」", "steam": "「喂，不是那樣吧！你這時應該說『一起負責吧』才對啦！」"}, "length": {"chs": 35, "steam": 27}, "similarity": 0.292}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "说着，纱凪从旁边顶了顶我。", "steam": "紗凪從旁邊撞我。"}, "length": {"chs": 13, "steam": 8}, "similarity": 0.333}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "然后将脸靠在我的手臂处。", "steam": "然後就這樣把臉頰貼在我的手臂上。"}, "length": {"chs": 12, "steam": 16}, "similarity": 0.462}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn7499", "steam": "sn7499", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「……不会暴露啦。\\n　反正活动室里总有各种各样的味道」", "steam": "「……不可能被發現的啦。畢竟那間社團教室總是有各種味道。」"}, "length": {"chs": 28, "steam": 29}, "similarity": 0.356}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「这倒没错」", "steam": "「這麼說也對。」"}, "length": {"chs": 6, "steam": 8}, "similarity": 0.0}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn7500", "steam": "sn7500", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「唉，难得激情过后想享受一下恩爱的余韵，\\n　结果根本没时间让咱俩慢慢享受啊……」", "steam": "「唉～難得的親親熱熱的餘韻，居然沒辦法兩個人好好享受……」"}, "length": {"chs": 41, "steam": 29}, "similarity": 0.172}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「毕竟地点不太合适……\\n　今后尽量还是找能慢慢享受的地方吧」", "steam": "「畢竟是那種場所……今後找事後可以安心放鬆的場所吧。」"}, "length": {"chs": 31, "steam": 27}, "similarity": 0.25}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn7501", "steam": "sn7501", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「嗯、嗯……不过，那个，唔，比起那些事……」", "steam": "「唔、嗯……但是、那個、呃、比起那個……」"}, "length": {"chs": 22, "steam": 21}, "similarity": 0.5}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn7502", "steam": "sn7502", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「……唔」", "steam": "「……嗯嗯。」"}, "length": {"chs": 5, "steam": 7}, "similarity": 0.0}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "她脸颊通红，撒娇似地蹭着我的胳膊。", "steam": "紅撲撲的臉蛋撒嬌地蹭了蹭。"}, "length": {"chs": 17, "steam": 13}, "similarity": 0.296}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "还有那双仰视着我的濡湿眼眸。", "steam": "然後抬起眼眸看我。"}, "length": {"chs": 14, "steam": 9}, "similarity": 0.286}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「啊……嗯，也是呢。\\n　今天的份就趁现在……哪怕一点点也好……」", "steam": "「啊……嗯，說的也對。今天的份現在來做吧……一點點也好……」"}, "length": {"chs": 33, "steam": 30}, "similarity": 0.524}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn7503", "steam": "sn7503", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「嗯」", "steam": "「嗯。」"}, "length": {"chs": 3, "steam": 4}, "similarity": 1.0}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "我紧紧地抱住了她。", "steam": "我抱住她。"}, "length": {"chs": 9, "steam": 5}, "similarity": 0.667}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "紧接着纱凪闭上了眼睛，抬起了下巴。", "steam": "紗凪閉上眼睛，抬起頭。"}, "length": {"chs": 17, "steam": 11}, "similarity": 0.5}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "我当即明白了她想要什么。", "steam": "跟剛才的眼神一樣，我立刻就理解了意思。"}, "length": {"chs": 12, "steam": 19}, "similarity": 0.143}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "紗凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn7504", "steam": "sn7504", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「嗯、啾……嗯……」", "steam": "「嗯、啾……嗯……」"}, "length": {"chs": 10, "steam": 10}, "similarity": 1.0}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "我轻轻地吻了吻她的嘴唇。", "steam": "嘴唇輕輕地碰觸她。"}, "length": {"chs": 12, "steam": 9}, "similarity": 0.421}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "纱凪可爱地抖了抖。", "steam": "……紗凪可愛地顫抖起來。"}, "length": {"chs": 9, "steam": 12}, "similarity": 0.471}
